OL,3,GNEWSARoad could partly reopen after
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiscussions are being held in the hope
OL,7,Fof partly reopening a key town centre
OL,8,Froute which has remained closed for a
OL,9,Fweek after a building site partially
OL,10,Fcollapsed.
OL,12,FTwo people were taken to hospital after
OL,13,Fan apartment block under construction
OL,14,Fpartly collapsed alongside scaffolding
OL,15,Fon the A4260 Cherwell Street in
OL,16,FBanbury, Oxfordshire, on 21 October.
OL,18,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,19,Fpreviously said it was investigating
OL,20,Fthe incident, and its inspectors had
OL,21,Fvisited the site as part of its
OL,22,Fenquiries.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
