OL,3,GNEWSARoad could partly reopen after
OL,4,Abuilding collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FCherwell District Council, which is
OL,7,Fmanaging the ongoing road closure, said
OL,8,Fon Wednesday that it was working to see
OL,9,Fif the route could be partly reopened.
